# CLAUDE.local.md — per-machine overlay. Claude Code loads this after CLAUDE.md.
#
# install.mjs creates this file from the template if you don't have one, and
# never overwrites it. It is not tracked by the dotfiles repo.
#
# Anything a teammate would have to change on their own laptop belongs here.
# Delete the lines you don't use — a wrong fact is worse than a missing one.

## This machine

- Shell: <PowerShell 5.1 / bash / zsh>
- Checkout of the MCPJam Inspector: <absolute path>
- Other checkouts worth knowing: <paths>
- `gh` authed as: <your GitHub handle>
- On PATH: <jq, rg, python, gh — whatever you actually have>
- Not on PATH: <the ones you don't, so Claude doesn't reach for them>

## Shell quirks

- If PowerShell: don't use `&&` between commands; chain with `;` or
  `if ($?) { ... }`. Set `$env:PYTHONIOENCODING="utf-8"` for Python that prints
  non-ASCII.
- If a guard hook blocks something you need, say so rather than working around
  it; `CLAUDE_GUARD_OFF=1` is the escape hatch.

## Me

- Name / how to refer to me: <optional>
- Anything about how you want to be worked with that isn't in CLAUDE.md
